From 43d891f748bda08d15ef911646b50382603cb0f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alaric McKenzie-Boone <alaric.mckenzie.boone@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 06:00:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add a dedicated opt-in Mother Bulbmin registration path
 (#131)

Register a labeled mother proxy identity separate from the Kochappy auto-attach, drive the source LeafChappy ten-body birthChildren flock, and release only wild dependents on mother death. Config gains an optional proxy model label (P2_BULBMIN_1 optional, P2_BULBMIN_2 required). Inert with no config; the LeafChappy/KumaChappy model and actor stay missing so the mother is an explicitly labeled Chappy-family proxy, never a fabricated render.
